                        },
                        "choices": [],
                        "prompt": {
                            "serial": "container_containerstatic_6008579e2ca99086977448",
                            "body": "\n            <p>The TAO team members reside all over the world with offices in Boston, Luxembourg and Minsk.</p>\n            <p>Dan, who works in Boston wants to visit the Luxembourg office and then a few days later go to Minsk.</p>\n            <p>The distances between these cities are:</p>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Boston to Luxembourg: <strong>3,572 miles</strong></li>\n              <li>Luxembourg to Minsk: <strong>973 miles</strong></li>\n            </ul>\n            <p>Once he arrives in Luxembourg, how much of the way has he done (in %, rounded up to a full integer)?</p>\n            <p>\u00a0</p>\n          ",
                            "elements": [],
                            "debug": {
                                "relatedItem": "item_6008579e2c7fc084663872"
                            }
                        }
